flowchart LR
    Start([Start with the job]) --> Live{Must it fit a live<br/>or strict-rate connection?}
    Live -->|Yes| CBR[Choose CBR]
    Live -->|No| Size{Must the file hit a size<br/>or average bitrate?}
    Size -->|Yes| VBR[Choose VBR]
    Size -->|No| Quality{Want a simple,<br/>steady quality target?}
    Quality -->|Yes| CRF[Choose CRF]
    Quality -->|No| CQP[Choose CQP<br/>for testing or capture]

